; XAUUSD_Loma_TrendPullback v1.35 on XAUUSD - best trailing of M30: Pivots trailing (TrailMode 12), setup 1 of 2: buy, session 0700-2000 server time, trend filter none, target 3R. DO NOT LOAD ON BTC.
; Trailing: stop beyond the last confirmed M30 swing with 3 bars on each side, from the minute after entry. Needs EA v1.35 or later (TrailMode 12, TrailParam 3).
; Picked on 1 Jan 2025 - 15 May 2026 only, by the one-minute backtest at the study's costs (FTMO spread, no commission; score 1.56): 92 trades, PF 1.88. Replay of the same months: 87 trades, PF 1.56.
; TICK REPLAY (every Dukascopy tick, the EA's rules; VT costs: VT's 0.15 spread scaled by Dukascopy's own spread, 0.60 USD commission per ounce). 16 May - 13 Nov 2026 (the trailing was chosen on these months): this setup 23 trades, PF 1.06, net +0.3R (stressed PF 1.07); the 2 setups of M30 + Pivots together 68 trades, PF 1.06, net +1.8R (stressed 1.05).
; Pivots trailing with its own setups was chosen as the best on M30 (highest PF of the EA's trailing systems with 30+ trades in those months: no system had 100 on M30, a thin result; each system has its own setups), so the 2026 figure is the score it was chosen by, not a test.
; EARLIER DATA, not used for any choice (same replay and costs): this setup: 15 Jul - 31 Dec 2024, 33 trades, PF 1.26. The 2 setups together: 15 Jul - 31 Dec 2024, 81 trades, PF 0.97. They did not hold (under 1.3): UNPROVEN, Strategy Tester and demo only.
; Needs a spread near VT's 0.15 USD: at Dukascopy's own wider spreads the 2 setups took 37 of the 68 trades in those months, PF 0.67.
; Data: Dukascopy XAUUSD ticks, broker server time. Commission is in the figures: set CommissionPerLot to your round-trip commission per lot.
; Times are BROKER SERVER TIME (New York + 7 h: GMT+2 in the US winter, GMT+3 in the US summer).
; UseNewsFilter is on: on demo or live the EA skips entries within 30 minutes of high-impact USD news, which the replay did not do (no effect in the Strategy Tester). Set it to false to trade exactly what was replayed.
